      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Thinking Machines Lab Releases Open-Weights AI Model 'Inkling'",
          "zh": "Thinking Machines Lab发布开源权重AI模型“Inkling”"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Mira Murati's Thinking Machines Lab has released Inkling, their first open-weights, Apache-2.0 licensed multimodal model.",
          "zh": "米拉·穆拉蒂的Thinking Machines Lab发布了其首个开源权重、Apache-2.0许可的多模态模型Inkling。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Inkling is a Mixture-of-Experts transformer with 975 billion total parameters and 41 billion active parameters.",
            "The model is multimodal, trained on 45 trillion tokens of text, images, audio, and video.",
            "Inkling is released under an Apache-2.0 license."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Inkling是一个专家混合Transformer模型，拥有9750亿总参数和410亿活跃参数。",
            "该模型是多模态的，通过45万亿文本、图像、音频和视频tokens进行训练。",
            "Inkling以Apache-2.0许可发布。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This release introduces a large-scale, multimodal model that could influence future research and applications in open-source AI. It represents a significant test for the viability of open-source AI.",
          "zh": "此次发布引入了一个大规模、多模态的模型，可能影响开源AI领域的未来研究和应用。它标志着对开源AI可行性的一次重要考验。"
        },
        "source": "Thinking Machines Lab",
        "link": "https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/introducing-inkling/"
      },
      {
        "title": {
