            "Its methodology involves self-play to drive improvements.",
            "The system targets enhanced AI safety, alignment, and prompt injection robustness."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "GPT-Red作为一个自动化红队系统运行。",
            "其方法论涉及利用自博弈来推动改进。",
            "该系统旨在增强AI安全性、对齐性和提示注入鲁棒性。"
          ]
        },
