          "en": "The development of systems like GPT-Red indicates a focus on autonomous methods for improving AI reliability and security. This approach could reduce reliance on human intervention for identifying and mitigating AI vulnerabilities.",
          "zh": "像GPT-Red这样的系统开发表明了AI行业正专注于利用自主方法来提高AI的可靠性和安全性。这种方法有望减少对人工干预的依赖，以识别和缓解AI漏洞。"
        },
